                                                                                                                                                                  'content' => '4,32,1',
                                                                                                                                                                  'info' => 'maximum packet size width  in words.
The maximum data that can be sent via one packet will be 2 power of MAX_DMA_TRANSACTION_WIDTH in words.'
                                                                                                                                                                },
